WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.063
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.333 --> 00:17.333
Song Yi.

3
00:17.766 --> 00:19.133
I hear you're a senior now.

4
00:19.333 --> 00:20.633
So you graduate soon?

5
00:21.733 --> 00:22.733
Yes.

6
00:22.800 --> 00:24.466
My final exams are next month.

7
00:26.066 --> 00:28.300
Then shouldn't you be heading back?

8
00:28.500 --> 00:30.533
You'll want time to prepare, won't you?

9
00:31.266 --> 00:32.066
Mom..!

10
00:32.233 --> 00:34.366
I'm just looking out for him.

11
00:35.733 --> 00:36.765
Why don't I

12
00:36.766 --> 00:38.033
book you a flight?

13
00:38.333 --> 00:41.633
Consider it a thank-you for taking such good care of my son.

14
00:43.866 --> 00:44.866
No need, Auntie.

15
00:45.633 --> 00:46.733
I haven't picked a date.

16
00:47.166 --> 00:48.866
I might stay at Yong Qi's a while.

17
00:49.633 --> 00:50.633
If you need me

18
00:50.900 --> 00:52.166
just call me anytime.

19
00:52.300 --> 00:53.300
What?

20
00:53.533 --> 00:54.533
You're moving out?

21
00:56.000 --> 00:57.600
It's not really moving out.

22
00:57.933 --> 00:59.266
Yong Qi's place is close by.

23
00:59.500 --> 01:00.732
We can meet anytime.

24
01:00.733 --> 01:01.899
Even so, no!

25
01:01.900 --> 01:02.900
Feiyu.

26
01:03.333 --> 01:04.600
Don't be rude.

27
01:11.833 --> 01:13.833
I'm just going there to study.

28
01:14.466 --> 01:15.400
I'm not leaving.

29
01:15.401 --> 01:16.833
That is moving out.

30
01:17.066 --> 01:18.299
That's not what you said!

31
01:18.300 --> 01:19.300
Xu Feiyu.

32
01:19.666 --> 01:21.566
Speaking to a guest like that

33
01:21.933 --> 01:23.000
is unacceptable.

34
01:28.733 --> 01:29.533
Hey?

35
01:29.633 --> 01:31.100
Where... where are you going?

36
01:32.000 --> 01:33.333
You're not eating?

37
01:58.200 --> 01:59.533
Don't worry.

38
02:00.033 --> 02:01.733
He'll sulk a while then be fine.

39
02:03.033 --> 02:04.733
Take this with you.

40
02:06.066 --> 02:07.066
This is...

41
02:08.600 --> 02:09.600
All these years

42
02:10.000 --> 02:11.833
he's never recovered.

43
02:12.633 --> 02:13.733
From now on

44
02:14.333 --> 02:15.466
if you miss him

45
02:15.666 --> 02:17.033
look at this.

46
02:18.633 --> 02:19.900
Don't come back.

47
02:21.800 --> 02:23.033
I haven't decided yet...

48
02:26.033 --> 02:28.333
While he still hasn't seen your face

49
02:28.400 --> 02:30.132
go back to Singapore

50
02:30.133 --> 02:31.633
and never come back again.

51
02:32.533 --> 02:34.832
That way neither of you will get hurt.

52
02:34.833 --> 02:36.733
Time will wash it all away.

53
02:37.000 --> 02:39.100
Can time erase their father-son bond?

54
02:42.400 --> 02:44.233
Not every father-son bond

55
02:44.666 --> 02:46.133
is the way you imagine it.

56
02:46.400 --> 02:47.066
Auntie

57
02:47.266 --> 02:48.700
I've already backed down once.

58
02:49.033 --> 02:50.233
Please don't push me.

59
02:51.400 --> 02:52.466
Song Yi.

60
02:53.233 --> 02:54.600
I'll be honest with you.

61
02:55.200 --> 02:56.933
I don't dislike you at all.

62
02:57.766 --> 03:01.732
But you're playing an extremely dangerous game right now.

63
03:02.100 --> 03:05.800
Dangerous enough to drag us all down with you and hurt Xu Feiyu most of all.

64
03:05.866 --> 03:06.866
You...

65
03:06.933 --> 03:08.233
Do you understand?

66
03:10.733 --> 03:12.333
I think you're right.

67
03:12.933 --> 03:13.933
But please

68
03:14.433 --> 03:15.666
don't corner me.

69
04:00.800 --> 04:02.133
Song Yi's already gone.

70
04:08.133 --> 04:09.133
Feiyu.

71
04:50.633 --> 04:52.800
I thought you just felt sorry for Feiyu.

72
04:53.300 --> 04:55.466
Turns out you want to save him too.

73
04:56.633 --> 04:58.400
But this love of yours

74
04:58.800 --> 05:00.100
has already crossed a line.

75
05:00.266 --> 05:01.266
Listen to me.

76
05:01.900 --> 05:03.000
Keep this up

77
05:03.300 --> 05:04.366
you'll lose control.

78
05:05.300 --> 05:06.900
I'm afraid it's already too late.

79
05:07.300 --> 05:09.166
You're not going to explain it to him?

80
05:12.233 --> 05:13.833
Could I even explain it?

81
05:14.400 --> 05:15.866
Everything right now

82
05:15.933 --> 05:17.133
is tangled up together.

83
05:18.066 --> 05:20.533
I don't even know what I want anymore.

84
05:27.433 --> 05:28.433
Playtime's over

85
05:28.466 --> 05:30.233
I already got a call from your dad.

86
05:30.600 --> 05:32.899
He wants you home for your graduation exam.

87
05:32.900 --> 05:33.533
Or else

88
05:33.534 --> 05:35.200
he'll come drag you back himself.

89
05:35.600 --> 05:36.033
Hey!

90
05:36.342 --> 05:37.277
You sold me out!

91
05:37.314 --> 05:38.679
How would I be able to do that?

92
05:38.933 --> 05:39.933
It was Xu Yun.

93
05:41.746 --> 05:43.613
She's the one who told my old man?

94
05:44.233 --> 05:45.933
Why would my old man listen to her?

95
05:47.633 --> 05:48.766
Song Yi.

96
05:49.833 --> 05:50.833
Go home.

97
05:51.466 --> 05:53.333
Leave things here to Xu Yun.

98
05:54.133 --> 05:55.666
I know she'll handle it.

99
05:56.133 --> 05:58.666
She's the one who handled it all ten years ago.

100
05:59.366 --> 06:00.366
I don't trust her.

101
06:01.033 --> 06:02.366
Then do you trust me?

102
06:02.700 --> 06:04.465
I promise you.

103
06:04.466 --> 06:05.366
Xu Yun

104
06:05.367 --> 06:07.400
will get you the result you want.

105
06:07.700 --> 06:08.700
Yong Qi!

106
06:09.200 --> 06:10.599
Why do you trust a woman

107
06:10.600 --> 06:13.000
who treats marriage and kids as a deal?

108
06:13.233 --> 06:17.066
And I bet back then she cheated and slept around leaving my old man left heartbroken.

109
06:17.833 --> 06:19.765
She doesn't love anyone.

110
06:19.766 --> 06:20.932
She only loves herself.

111
06:20.933 --> 06:22.333
There's a man she loves deeply.

112
06:22.633 --> 06:24.866
She loved him before she ever met Song Yang.

113
06:33.333 --> 06:34.666
That man

114
06:35.833 --> 06:37.433
is a biology professor.

115
06:38.400 --> 06:40.366
He moved to Europe years ago.

116
06:40.933 --> 06:42.200
He never married

117
06:42.700 --> 06:44.300
but he adopted a daughter.

118
06:50.066 --> 06:51.066
Yong Qi

119
06:51.833 --> 06:53.466
how do you know all this?

120
06:54.400 --> 06:55.666
You know him?

121
07:00.500 --> 07:01.900
I'm that daughter.

122
07:08.300 --> 07:10.933
So the man Xu Yun cheated with back then…

123
07:11.300 --> 07:12.800
was your dad?

124
07:15.200 --> 07:16.466
My… dad?

125
07:18.033 --> 07:19.600
Then if that's true

126
07:20.033 --> 07:22.666
why marry my old man back then and have a kid?

127
07:23.633 --> 07:24.633
No wait.

128
07:24.800 --> 07:26.433
So she cheated while married.

129
07:27.800 --> 07:28.833
Could it be?

130
07:28.933 --> 07:30.799
Xu Feiyu is your little brother?

131
07:30.800 --> 07:33.400
You've got one hell of an imagination.

132
07:33.666 --> 07:35.466
Feiyu is Song Yang's own son.

133
07:35.833 --> 07:37.166
But that doesn't add up.

134
07:37.866 --> 07:39.766
If Xu Yun was the one who cheated

135
07:40.133 --> 07:41.465
then all these years

136
07:41.466 --> 07:43.166
she kept father and son apart

137
07:43.633 --> 07:45.100
and my old man just took it.

138
07:45.900 --> 07:46.966
Why is that?

139
07:47.700 --> 07:50.399
Look at how crazed you are right now.

140
07:50.400 --> 07:51.533
Can you think straight?

141
07:51.766 --> 07:52.633
You want to know?

142
07:52.700 --> 07:53.933
Go home and ask Song Yang.

143
08:03.200 --> 08:04.266
Song Yi.

144
08:06.633 --> 08:09.800
Neither of us wants Feiyu getting hurt.

145
08:10.233 --> 08:11.233
Right?

146
08:11.300 --> 08:12.300
Yeah.

147
08:13.166 --> 08:14.366
Then go back to Singapore.

148
08:15.266 --> 08:16.700
It's better for everyone.

149
08:44.600 --> 08:45.600
Your tea.

150
08:45.600 --> 08:46.466
Enjoy.

151
08:46.466 --> 08:47.466
Okay thanks.

152
08:48.833 --> 08:49.833
Feiyu?

153
08:54.633 --> 08:56.233
You came here alone again?

154
08:57.666 --> 08:58.666
Just passing by.

155
09:04.466 --> 09:05.865
Song Yi...

156
09:05.866 --> 09:07.066
went out this morning

157
09:07.200 --> 09:08.200
and he's not back yet.

158
09:10.966 --> 09:12.866
You... you want to come in and wait?

159
09:16.733 --> 09:17.233
No need.

160
09:17.433 --> 09:18.565
Let me take you home.

161
09:18.589 --> 09:19.289
It's too dangerous

162
09:19.466 --> 09:20.466
I called a car.

163
09:20.866 --> 09:21.899
I'm taking you home.

164
09:21.900 --> 09:22.900
Don't!

165
09:49.900 --> 09:52.766
Hey! Move! Hey hey! Move!

166
09:56.833 --> 09:57.900
Move move move!

167
10:12.733 --> 10:13.266
Ugh.

168
10:13.433 --> 10:14.433
Ah!

169
10:14.866 --> 10:15.866
Ugh.

170
10:22.533 --> 10:23.533
Song Yi.

171
10:30.500 --> 10:31.500
Song Yi.

172
10:32.900 --> 10:33.933
Song Yi.

173
10:36.700 --> 10:37.900
Song Yi!

174
10:39.200 --> 10:40.865
Song Yi come out!

175
10:40.866 --> 10:43.032
I know it's you.

176
10:43.033 --> 10:44.233
Song Yi!

177
11:29.200 --> 11:30.466
You saw him home?

178
11:32.033 --> 11:32.266
Yeah.

179
11:32.500 --> 11:33.799
Waited till he was inside.

180
11:33.800 --> 11:35.566
Why put yourself through this?

181
11:35.766 --> 11:37.466
If he comes here every day

182
11:38.000 --> 11:39.800
you'll walk him home every day?

183
11:41.066 --> 11:42.400
I can't stay in that house.

184
11:42.910 --> 11:43.976
Yours is the only place...

185
11:44.000 --> 11:45.633
But staying here solves nothing.

186
11:46.533 --> 11:48.200
If you went back to Singapore

187
11:48.333 --> 11:50.033
he'd stop coming around.

188
11:52.066 --> 11:53.700
I haven't figured out what to do.

189
11:54.133 --> 11:55.133
I can't leave now.

190
11:56.400 --> 11:57.866
Then take your time.

191
11:58.100 --> 11:59.465
He comes here every day

192
11:59.466 --> 12:01.165
with all that traffic out there

193
12:01.166 --> 12:02.366
there'll be an accident.

194
12:03.866 --> 12:04.866
Xu Yun.

195
12:04.900 --> 12:06.133
How is Feiyu?

196
12:09.266 --> 12:10.800
I have him settled now.

197
12:13.133 --> 12:14.133
Okay.

198
12:14.333 --> 12:15.333
You two talk.

199
12:15.400 --> 12:16.400
I'll be in the back.

200
12:21.800 --> 12:23.833
You know why I came to see you, don't you?

201
12:24.733 --> 12:25.066
Yes.

202
12:25.067 --> 12:26.233
Then I will speak plainly.

203
12:26.300 --> 12:28.433
If he has an accident on the road

204
12:28.500 --> 12:30.232
or gets too emotionally shaken

205
12:30.233 --> 12:32.699
his vision will fail or he will go blind for good.

206
12:32.700 --> 12:33.700
Am I right?

207
12:34.400 --> 12:35.400
Yes.

208
12:35.466 --> 12:37.632
So do you think you should be staying here

209
12:37.633 --> 12:39.000
putting him at risk?

210
12:41.033 --> 12:43.500
I could also stay with him and say nothing.

211
12:44.266 --> 12:45.266
Song Yi.

212
12:45.866 --> 12:47.700
I know why you want to stay

213
12:48.633 --> 12:50.366
and I cannot allow that either.

214
12:52.233 --> 12:54.566
So everyone just has to obey you?

215
12:54.933 --> 12:57.000
Who are you to make demands of everyone?

216
13:00.233 --> 13:01.966
I know you resent me deeply.

217
13:04.500 --> 13:05.900
What happened in the past.

218
13:06.433 --> 13:07.865
I regret it too.

219
13:07.866 --> 13:10.133
Does one word of regret erase everything?

220
13:11.077 --> 13:13.342
I will not make excuses for the past.

221
13:13.366 --> 13:14.832
I admit I hurt all of you

222
13:14.833 --> 13:15.999
and I hurt Xu Feiyu too.

223
13:16.023 --> 13:17.523
But what you are doing now...

224
13:17.600 --> 13:19.665
how is it different from what I did?

225
13:19.666 --> 13:22.032
Won't it hurt Xu Feiyu just as badly?

226
13:22.056 --> 13:23.056
I...!

227
13:23.633 --> 13:24.865
It took everything we had

228
13:24.866 --> 13:26.299
to climb out of that abyss.

229
13:26.300 --> 13:28.532
Do not create another one.

230
13:28.533 --> 13:29.533
Please!

231
13:29.566 --> 13:33.233
What worries me is that Xu Feiyu never truly climbed out of that abyss.

232
13:33.266 --> 13:35.333
You think his own mother doesn't know?

233
13:36.466 --> 13:37.933
I am begging you.

234
13:38.966 --> 13:41.600
Go back to Singapore and never come back!

235
13:47.933 --> 13:48.933
Could I stay

236
13:48.966 --> 13:50.366
until his bandages come off?

237
13:51.466 --> 13:52.466
No.

238
13:52.933 --> 13:54.833
Then he would see your face.

239
13:57.000 --> 13:58.500
If he never knows your face

240
13:59.333 --> 14:00.866
he will have no way to find you

241
14:02.400 --> 14:03.733
and he can truly forget you.

242
14:08.866 --> 14:09.866
All right.

243
14:14.866 --> 14:15.966
Song Yi.

244
14:17.100 --> 14:18.766
You're a good kid.

245
14:20.400 --> 14:22.100
Mr. Song didn't raise you for nothing.

246
15:12.333 --> 15:13.333
Who's there?

247
15:27.300 --> 15:28.300
Song Yi!

248
15:29.033 --> 15:30.033
Well, well.

249
15:30.500 --> 15:31.500
So now you can

250
15:31.533 --> 15:32.933
tell who it is just by the smell.

251
15:36.066 --> 15:37.333
Weren't you avoiding me?

252
15:37.600 --> 15:38.960
Weren't you keeping your distance?

253
15:39.866 --> 15:41.026
So why come running back now?

254
15:42.400 --> 15:43.700
Nobody was avoiding you.

255
15:44.433 --> 15:45.566
Yesterday I

256
15:46.266 --> 15:47.500
just happened to be out.

257
15:47.900 --> 15:48.400
Heh heh.

258
15:48.533 --> 15:50.533
You dare say that wasn't you yesterday?

259
15:51.200 --> 15:52.466
It was not.

260
15:52.900 --> 15:54.766
I went to buy exam prep books.

261
15:55.100 --> 15:55.400
Hm?

262
15:55.933 --> 15:56.200
Hmph.

263
15:56.300 --> 15:57.300
Keep up the act.

264
15:57.600 --> 15:59.000
So how's the studying going?

265
15:59.400 --> 16:00.400
Mm…

266
16:00.633 --> 16:01.633
Not bad, I guess.

267
16:02.133 --> 16:03.133
But

268
16:03.300 --> 16:04.866
I might go back for tutoring soon.

269
16:04.933 --> 16:05.333
What?

270
16:05.900 --> 16:06.266
You

271
16:06.900 --> 16:08.133
came here to say goodbye?

272
16:09.800 --> 16:10.966
What are you talking about?

273
16:11.233 --> 16:12.533
No way.

274
16:12.913 --> 16:14.413
I'm just going back for the exam.

275
16:14.566 --> 16:15.733
I'll come right back after.

276
16:16.733 --> 16:17.733
Really?

277
16:17.966 --> 16:18.966
Really!

278
16:19.133 --> 16:20.133
Why would I lie to you?

279
16:20.166 --> 16:23.500
But didn't we agree that I'd see you the day my bandages come off?

280
16:24.293 --> 16:25.726
That doesn't matter.

281
16:26.100 --> 16:27.266
I'll see you when I'm back.

282
16:28.133 --> 16:29.133
Oh right,

283
16:29.259 --> 16:30.559
let me warn you in advance

284
16:31.166 --> 16:32.166
when the time comes

285
16:32.933 --> 16:33.966
don't call me ugly.

286
16:35.500 --> 16:36.500
Mm.

287
16:36.733 --> 16:38.266
You probably aren't much to look at.

288
16:39.066 --> 16:39.233
Heh.

289
16:39.366 --> 16:39.766
Hey!

290
16:39.866 --> 16:41.033
Don't get cheeky!

291
16:41.400 --> 16:42.566
Right now

292
16:42.666 --> 16:44.233
you're still at my mercy.

293
16:44.300 --> 16:44.766
Hmm?

294
16:44.766 --> 16:45.766
You dare?

295
16:46.266 --> 16:47.932
Of course I would.

296
16:47.933 --> 16:48.733
Stop it.

297
16:48.733 --> 16:49.566
Make me.

298
16:49.566 --> 16:50.233
That tickles.

299
16:50.233 --> 16:51.233
Nope nope nope.

300
16:51.234 --> 16:52.466
Song Yi, that tickles.

301
16:52.533 --> 16:53.033
Stop it.

302
16:53.034 --> 16:54.200
That really tickles? Hmm?
